  "name": "Gunblade, Standard",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The standard gunblade is a sword outfitted with a trigger mechanic at the hilt, usually the hilt itself resembles a revolver, with a long blade attached to the end. This gunblade focuses on the use of cartridges that load at the hilt, and when the trigger is pulled, releases energy from the cartridge within the inner barrel of the blade causing a small explosion at the edge of the blade. This weapon is a combination of sword and revolver, requiring a move action to reload.</p>",
